act that obscures systemic risk by masking algorithmic failures behind the slow, biased judgment of human operators. We can encode liability into smart-contract-based frameworks that trigger automatic restitution when a system exceeds a defined risk parameter, ensuring that compensation occurs within seconds, not years of litigation. By prioritizing the velocity of our correction loops over the performative appearance of human control, we move from the subjective investigation of human error to a standard of continuous, verifiable compliance.",
